{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Extend binder configuration infrastructure to allow dynamically qualified multiple binder instances for the same binder type.",
    "Utilize Hadoop Configuration object with standard `fs.defaultFS` and HA nameservice properties for resolving HDFS custom module locations.",
    "Migrate Cassandra sink and PMML processor modules into Spring Cloud Stream standalone application structure leveraging Spring Boot auto-configuration.",
    "Implement REST endpoints in Spring XD Admin UI server returning JSON DTOs representing job composition metadata (isComposed flag) and graph node/edge structures.",
    "Enhance the XD Admin Web UI using the existing frontend framework (Ember.js/JavaScript) to render composed job badges and graph visualizers with drill-down links."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Development and testing environment includes accessible Hadoop cluster configured for High Availability (HA) NameNode.",
    "Target environment is using Java 17+ and the Spring Framework 6.x / Spring Boot 3.x baseline.",
    "Existing Cassandra and JPMML libraries are compatible with the target Spring Cloud Stream version.",
    "All UI changes build upon the existing Spring XD UI project structure and component patterns."
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-1",
      "activity_name": "Multi-binder Configuration & Routing Support (U1)",
      "activity_description": "Implement core framework changes allowing multiple binder target configurations for the same binding type, enabling concurrent multi-system reading and writing within a single application or pipeline.",
      "most_likely_effort": 20
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-2",
      "activity_name": "HDFS Custom Module HA NameNode Support (U2)",
      "activity_description": "Modify HDFS module locator logic to properly parse logical HA nameservices and leverage NameNodeProxies HA resolution rather than falling back to non-HA proxies.",
      "most_likely_effort": 12
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-3",
      "activity_name": "Port Cassandra Sink Module to Spring Cloud Stream (U3)",
      "activity_description": "Extract the Cassandra sink module from Spring XD, convert it into a Spring Cloud Stream app, update Spring Data Cassandra dependencies, and add unit/integration tests.",
      "most_likely_effort": 14
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-4",
      "activity_name": "Port Analytic PMML Processor Module to Spring Cloud Stream (U4)",
      "activity_description": "Port the PMML evaluation processor module from Spring XD to Spring Cloud Stream, upgrade PMML evaluator libraries, implement auto-configuration, and create test scenarios.",
      "most_likely_effort": 16
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-5",
      "activity_name": "Job Composition REST Endpoints (U5, U6)",
      "activity_description": "Develop REST controller endpoints and underlying service logic in XD Admin to expose job composition flags and composition graph representations for parent-child job definitions.",
      "most_likely_effort": 16
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-6",
      "activity_name": "Job Composition UI Enhancements & Navigation (U7, U8)",
      "activity_description": "Update Web UI views to display visual indicators for composed vs. standalone jobs, render the composition graph, and provide deep links to individual job detail pages.",
      "most_likely_effort": 18
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-7",
      "activity_name": "Integration Testing & Technical Documentation",
      "activity_description": "Conduct end-to-end testing across multi-binder setups, HA HDFS module resolution, REST APIs, UI job navigation, and update relevant user and developer documentation.",
      "most_likely_effort": 14
    }
  ],
  "reported_total": {
    "most_likely_effort": 110
  }
}
```

